{"lyrics":"[Intro: Future]\n[00:02.76]Just like an astronaut\n[00:05.94]We don't detox\n[00:09.06]Yeah\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Future]\n[00:11.34]Playin' in the mud, all these drugs like a weirdo (Wheezy outta here, yeah)One of a kind, VVS diamonds on my earlobe (On my earlobe)\n[00:17.58]Hop in that 'Rari, I drive fast, I'm an A-hole (Skrrt), I got cash flow (Woah)\n[00:21.84]Bitch droppin' her ass low (Woah, woah), ridin' dick like a lasso (Yeah)\n[00:24.98]40 on me, it's fuego hot, uh, give you a halo\n[00:28.14]At your neck, ready or not (\n[00:29.44]Ready or\n[00:29.60]), me and Pluto astronauts (\n[00:31.20]Woah\n[00:31.28])\n[Verse 1: Future]\n[00:31.34]Alien, I'm not a regular guy (I'm not a), Emilio Pucci, not regular fly (This not a regular)\n[00:34.74]It's been a year since I went in the mall, I'm not no regular guy (Woah)\n[00:37.86]We put them beams on a semi, you better be ready to die (Woah, woah)\n[00:40.98]I got on wings like a Bentley, I feel way too high (I got them wings on)\n[00:44.10]Left the sticker on the window, still got the paper tag (Yeah)\n[00:47.24]Louis Vuitton bandana, too many shoppin' bags (Too many shoppin' bags)\n[00:50.36]Richard Mille or the Rollie, it don't tick-tock-tock (It don't tick-tock)\n[00:53.44]Hermès bandana just like 2Pac (Just like 2Pac)\n[00:56.66]My lil' brother, he a scammer, ride with two choppers (Ride with two choppers)\n[00:59.82]We want ecstasy and codeine, we don't detox (We don't detox)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:02.64]Balenciagas on my feet, these ain't no Reeboks (Yeah)\n[01:05.62]I grew up a bad kid, coulda been on The Boondocks (Yeah)\n[01:08.66]I keep my hand on my tool, ah (Woo), clip look like a ruler (Woo)\n[01:11.84]I roll with them shooters, shooters\n[01:13.30]Ain't with the talking, we just do it (Hah)\n[01:14.84]Stripper bitch, big ol' booty\n[01:16.40]Your ho dirty, she got cooties (Yup)\n[01:18.08]Big ol' 30, it'll do you, uh\n[01:19.92]I shoot that shit like a movie\n[01:21.08]White bitch nerdy, her name Susie, uh\n[01:22.94]The bitch head game go stupid, uh\n[01:24.40]Birkin bag on my back hold an Uzi, uh\n[01:25.94]Two Percs to the face, I'm booted up\n[Verse 3: Future]\n[01:27.18]Blood on my hands (Blood on my hands), blood in my eyes (Blood in my eyes)\n[01:30.06]Codeine my cup (Codeine in my cup), money on my mind (Money on my mind)\n[01:33.06]If I take this Percocet, I'm tryna see the stars (I'm seein' stars)\n[01:36.10]Press 'em today, ain't see you niggas, I got bars (Pluto)\n[01:39.84]Hope you never get to murder solvin' like nothin' wrong\n[01:42.96]Hope the day you run into your opps, you get 'em gone (Murder)\n[01:46.12]I be with my Chitown brothers, Al Capone (Slatt)\n[01:48.78]Me and Juice killin' these niggas like they got they hands down\n[01:51.86]Blood in my eyes (Blood in my eyes), blood on my hands (Blood on my hands)\n[01:56.58]Blood in my cup (Blood in my cup), blood on my hands (Slatt)\n[01:59.34]Made a million dollars in abandoned buildings (A mil')\n[02:01.68]Drinkin' out the bottle, you abandoned my feelings (Oh, yeah)\n[02:04.94]I took three 10s and went hasta luego\n[02:07.98]Juice WRLD probably in that 'Rari actin' an A-hole (Skrrt, skrrt)\n[02:11.04]I'm with some bartenders, they bad like J-Lo (Facts)\n[02:14.16]Keep the cannon like a tummy tuck, pushin' yayo (Woah)\n[02:17.26]Blow my head off, she deserve Chanel Coco (Woah)\n[02:20.38]I got dirty bands, I'm gettin' my El Chapo (Freebandz)\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Future]\n[02:23.22]I drive fast, I'm an A-hole (Gone), I got cash flow (I got cash)\n[02:26.52]Bitch droppin' her ass low (Yeah), ridin' dick like a lasso (Woah)\n[02:29.86]40 on me, it's fuego hot, uh, give you a halo\n[02:32.52]At your neck, ready or not, me and Pluto astronauts\n[02:35.64]I drive fast, hasta luego, I got cash flow (I got cash)\n[02:39.06]Bitch droppin' her ass low (Ass), ride the shit like my last ho (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:42.12]Chopper on me, I'm B.G. hot (Hot), give you a halo\n[02:45.24]At your neck, ready or not, me and Juice astronauts","words":[[2.76,2.86,"Just"],[2.9,3.04,"like"],[3.2,3.22,"an"],[3.3,3.78,"astronaut"],[5.94,5.96,"We"],[6.02,6.2,"don't"],[6.3,6.62,"detox"],[9.06,11.3,"Yeah"],[11.34,11.52,"Playin'"],[11.56,11.6,"in"],[11.64,11.68,"the"],[11.74,11.9,"mud,"],[12.0,12.14,"all"],[12.32,12.58,"these"],[12.72,12.88,"drugs"],[12.92,13.12,"like"],[13.16,13.16,"a"],[13.32,13.74,"weirdo"],[13.88,14.46,"(Wheezy"],[14.5,14.6,"outta"],[14.66,14.74,"here,"],[14.9,15.16,"yeah)One"],[15.22,15.24,"of"],[15.28,15.28,"a"],[15.34,15.42,"kind,"],[15.46,15.58,"VVS"],[15.64,16.0,"diamonds"],[16.06,16.1,"on"],[16.16,16.18,"my"],[16.22,16.34,"earlobe"],[16.38,16.4,"(On"],[16.44,16.46,"my"],[16.5,17.06,"earlobe)"],[17.58,17.66,"Hop"],[17.7,17.72,"in"],[17.76,17.82,"that"],[17.86,18.3,"'Rari,"],[18.38,18.38,"I"],[18.5,18.68,"drive"],[18.72,19.14,"fast,"],[19.18,19.3,"I'm"],[19.36,19.42,"an"],[19.62,20.18,"A-hole"],[20.22,20.38,"(Skrrt),"],[20.76,20.76,"I"],[20.8,20.92,"got"],[21.06,21.38,"cash"],[21.44,21.64,"flow"],[21.68,21.74,"(Woah)"],[21.84,22.1,"Bitch"],[22.22,22.52,"droppin'"],[22.64,22.68,"her"],[22.74,22.94,"ass"],[23.04,23.14,"low"],[23.18,23.24,"(Woah,"],[23.28,23.38,"woah),"],[23.42,23.72,"ridin'"],[23.8,23.88,"dick"],[23.92,24.1,"like"],[24.16,24.16,"a"],[24.2,24.62,"lasso"],[24.78,24.96,"(Yeah)"],[24.98,25.0,"40"],[25.24,25.26,"on"],[25.34,25.42,"me,"],[25.52,25.64,"it's"],[25.72,26.0,"fuego"],[26.12,26.28,"hot,"],[26.38,26.66,"uh,"],[26.9,26.98,"give"],[27.02,27.06,"you"],[27.18,27.18,"a"],[27.3,27.76,"halo"],[28.14,28.24,"At"],[28.34,28.4,"your"],[28.48,28.68,"neck,"],[28.88,29.02,"ready"],[29.14,29.16,"or"],[29.24,29.36,"not"],[29.38,29.4,"("],[29.44,29.52,"Ready"],[29.56,29.58,"or"],[29.6,29.62,"),"],[29.66,29.72,"me"],[29.84,29.9,"and"],[29.98,30.24,"Pluto"],[30.48,31.1,"astronauts"],[31.12,31.16,"("],[31.2,31.26,"Woah"],[31.28,31.3,")"],[31.34,31.6,"Alien,"],[31.64,31.7,"I'm"],[31.76,31.88,"not"],[31.94,31.94,"a"],[32.02,32.34,"regular"],[32.4,3